      <column caption='BigPictureText' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_0975577890340864]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;What the Big Picture chart show us&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;  The three charts provide an overview of how the main household waste treatment routes in England have changed over recent years.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;  Incineration shows a gradual upward trend, while recycling remains relatively stable, with limited change between reporting periods. At the same time, landfill shows a gradual decline.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;  Together\, the charts provide a starting point for exploring how England&apos;s household waste management is changing over time. The following sections will show these patterns in greater detail across regions, materials and treatment routes.&quot;' />
      </column>
