          <encoding attr='color' field='[none:Calculation_0975577890340864:nk]' type='palette'>
            <map to='#5c6068'>
              <bucket>&quot;What the Big Picture chart show us&#13;
&#13;
  The three charts provide an overview of how the main household waste treatment routes in England have changed over recent years.&#13;
&#13;
  Incineration shows a gradual upward trend, while recycling remains relatively stable, with limited change between reporting periods. At the same time, landfill shows a gradual decline.&#13;
&#13;
  Together\\, the charts provide a starting point for exploring how England&apos;s household waste management is changing over time. The following sections will show these patterns in greater detail across regions, materials and treatment routes.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
          </encoding>
