        <cols>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</cols>
        <annotations>
          <annotation class='point' id='4' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='367'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>The lack of support on landfill by the British Government increasing taxes, and other factors like lack of land in London. This ended up with a </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>drop of 96%</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'> since 2015/16.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0.322034'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <fields>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                    </fields>
                    <multibucket>
                      <bucket>&quot;2024/25&quot;</bucket>
                    </multibucket>
                  </node-reference>
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord axis-value='86959.879285499876'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <axis>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</axis>
                  </node-reference>
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-269' y='-80' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='5' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='299'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>The fact that reycling/reuse tratment route is not improving as fast as is desired the last ten years, made incineration increase in amount of burned tonnes. This is an </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>increase of 28%</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'> since 2015/16.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0.0282486'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <fields>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                    </fields>
                    <multibucket>
                      <bucket>&quot;2024/25&quot;</bucket>
                    </multibucket>
                  </node-reference>
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord axis-value='677044.77443710621'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <axis>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</axis>
                  </node-reference>
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-117' y='148' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='6' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='180'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='9'>In COVID-19,expecting a bit packaging waste, maybe becasue peopleordered more online, but the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>increase was a 0.06%</run>
              <run fontsize='9'>Æ  </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0.430681'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <fields>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                    </fields>
                    <multibucket>
                      <bucket>&quot;2020/21&quot;</bucket>
                    </multibucket>
                  </node-reference>
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord axis-value='713668.89734472416'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <axis>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</axis>
                  </node-reference>
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-92' y='122' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='7' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='88'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
