  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 2'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='4868' maxwidth='1366' minheight='4868' minwidth='1366' preset-index='0' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone friendly-name='Introduction' h='100000' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <zone fixed-size='142' friendly-name='MainTitle' h='2917' id='5' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone fixed-size='81' forceUpdate='true' h='2897' id='6' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#18527f' fontsize='20'>What happens to our waste: Residual Waste in England</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#18527f' fontsize='15' italic='true'>Following a decade of change in where England&apos;s residual waste goes and how it is treated</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='30' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='271' friendly-name='IntroTextPicture' h='5567' id='9' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='2917'>
              <zone fixed-size='724' h='5567' id='10' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/IntroductionPictureAlltogether.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='53586' x='0' y='2917'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-top' value='40' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding-bottom' value='40' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='10' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='63' h='5567' id='17' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='5198' x='53586' y='2917'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='555' forceUpdate='true' h='5567' id='11' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='41216' x='58784' y='2917'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    Every day, millions of items are thrown into bins across England. Once the collection vehicle disappears down the road, most of us give little thought to what happens next.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    But throwing something </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff'>away</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'> is only the beginning of its journey.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    Waste moves through a complex network of collection systems, sorting centres and treatment facilities. Some materials return to the economy through </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff'>recycling</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>, some organic waste can be composted or treated biologically, while residual waste may ultimately be </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff'>incinerated or sent to landfill</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='40' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='20' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='150' friendly-name='SecondIntroText' h='3081' id='14' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='8484'>
              <zone fixed-size='912' forceUpdate='true' h='3081' id='13' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='66764' x='0' y='8484'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>   Over the last ten years, however, the balance between these treatment routes has been changing.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    This dashboard follows that journey through England&apos;s waste data, exploring </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0000ff'>how the waste we throw is treated, where it goes and how the picture differs across the country</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>  So, what is happening to England&apos;s waste — and what does the changing destination of that waste tell us about the country&apos;s approach to managing it?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='60' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='386' h='3081' id='20' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/EnergyRecovery.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='28258' x='66764' y='8484'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-top' value='5' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='70' />
                  <format attr='padding-bottom' value='5' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='100' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='12' h='411' id='28' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='100000' x='0' y='11565'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='160' friendly-name='HouseholdRoute' h='3287' id='24' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='11976'>
              <zone fixed-size='437' h='3287' id='25' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/FamilyHome.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='31991' x='0' y='11976'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='50' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='150' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='493' forceUpdate='true' h='3287' id='26' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='36091' x='31991' y='11976'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#18527f' underline='true'>Waste Collected from households</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    Before waste can be recycled, treated or disposed of, first, it has to be collected. Across England, household waste enters the system through different collection streams, from residual waste and dry recycling to food and garden waste. What goes into each bin helps determine where it can go next.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='20' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='20' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='436' h='3287' id='27' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/RightDownArrow.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='31918' x='68082' y='11976'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-top' value='40' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='270' />
                  <format attr='padding-bottom' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='160' friendly-name='CollectionRoute' h='3287' id='29' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='15263'>
              <zone fixed-size='708' forceUpdate='true' h='3287' id='31' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='51684' x='0' y='15263'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#18527f'>  Once the waste collected by the rubbish/recycling service Collection vehicles transport different waste streams to facilities where materials can be received, stored, sorted and prepared for further treatment.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='200' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='160' h='3287' id='32' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/LeftDownArrow.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='11713' x='51684' y='15263'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-top' value='40' />
                  <format attr='padding-bottom' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='40' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='500' h='3287' id='30' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/LorryStorage.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='36603' x='63397' y='15263'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='150' />
                  <format attr='padding-left' value='20' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#eef1f3' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='1300' minheight='1300' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
