                    <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='5' />
                    <format attr='padding-right' value='10' />
                    <format attr='padding-left' value='10' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='477' h='2465' id='43' is-fixed='true' name='KPIfacilities' show-title='false' w='35505' x='32577' y='24240'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-h='95' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#18527f' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='5' />
                    <format attr='padding-right' value='10' />
                    <format attr='padding-left' value='10' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='428' h='2465' id='44' is-fixed='true' name='KPImaterial' show-title='false' w='31918' x='68082' y='24240'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-h='97' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#18527f' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='5' />
                    <format attr='padding-right' value='10' />
                    <format attr='padding-left' value='10' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='600' friendly-name='IncinerationLandfill' h='12325' id='65' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='26705'>
                <zone fixed-size='699' friendly-name='LineChart' h='12325' id='71' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='26705'>
                  <zone fixed-size='972' h='12325' id='66' is-fixed='true' name='LineResidualWasteTonnes' w='71742' x='0' y='26705'>
                    <layout-cache minheight='195' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='386' h='12325' id='206' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='28258' x='71742' y='26705'>
                    <zone fixed-size='374' forceUpdate='true' h='7888' id='72' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='28258' x='71742' y='26705'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555'>    As landfill declines, incineration becomes increasingly important in London’s residual waste management.</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555'>    One possible factor is Landfill Tax, introduced in 1996, alongside improvements in recycling, reuse and composting routes designed to encourage alternatives to landfill.</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555'>    However, while recycling has broadly plateaued, residual waste needs to be managed. With less waste going to landfill and limited growth in recycling, incineration has become an increasingly important route for managing residual waste in London.</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='5' />
                        <format attr='padding' value='5' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone h='4437' id='209' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='28258' x='71742' y='34593'>
                      <zone h='4437' id='208' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Landfill.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='14129' x='71742' y='34593'>
                        <zone-style>
                          <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                          <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                          <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                          <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                          <format attr='padding-bottom' value='65' />
                        </zone-style>
                      </zone>
                      <zone h='4437' id='207' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Incineration.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='14129' x='85871' y='34593'>
                        <zone-style>
                          <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                          <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                          <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                          <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                          <format attr='padding-top' value='0' />
                          <format attr='padding-bottom' value='70' />
                        </zone-style>
                      </zone>
                    </zone>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='500' friendly-name='Map' h='10271' id='189' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='39030'>
                <zone fixed-size='743' h='10271' id='190' is-fixed='true' name='FacilityTypesMap' show-title='false' w='54978' x='0' y='39030'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='201' minwidth='201' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='10271' id='259' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='45022' x='54978' y='39030'>
                  <zone fixed-size='41' h='1006' id='260' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='45022' x='54978' y='39030'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#2a5783' fontsize='14'>London has to send their waste to other regions</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='102' h='2095' id='267' is-fixed='true' name='MapButtonFacility' show-title='false' w='45022' x='54978' y='40036'>
                    <layout-cache fixed-size-w='313' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin-left' value='50' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='852' forceUpdate='true' h='7170' id='194' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='45022' x='54978' y='42131'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>    London&apos;s </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>main internal incineration</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'> facilities include: Bexley, Enfield, and Lewisham; and one </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>primary  landfill</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'> facility is Havering.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>    London moved around </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>5M tonnes between 2015 and 2025</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'> to incineration facilties in other regions in England. This means London </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>cannot burn all the residual waste generated within its borders</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>    The same happens with landfill, although the waste sent to landfill continues to decline every year, London buries  around </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>1M tonnes</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'> every year to other regions landfill; the tonnes are gradually decreasing each year.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='579' h='11894' id='195' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='49301'>
                <zone fixed-size='518' forceUpdate='true' h='11894' id='203' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='38507' x='0' y='49301'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#18527f'>      Do not get confused about the what the London map is showing. London is a busy crowded city with big differences between different boroughs. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    As I mentioned before, London has four mayor incineration with EfW, three of them are located in the est-south of London, probably this can be one of the reasons why south boroughs show bigger waste sent to incineration. Another important reason why can influence this figures is the percentage of population that lives in flats or houses.   </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#18527f'>    The reason I mentioned previously is not the only one that could cause the waste amount movement to southern areas of London; </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='832' h='11894' id='198' is-fixed='true' name='LondonMap' show-title='false' w='61493' x='38507' y='49301'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='201' minwidth='201' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='600' friendly-name='EnergyRecovery' h='13352' id='134' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='61195'>
                <zone h='12325' id='240' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='40702' x='0' y='62222'>
                  <zone fixed-size='497' forceUpdate='true' h='10292' id='166' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='40702' x='0' y='62222'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Incineration is divided into two main routes:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Æ          </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Bold'>with energy recovery </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold'>(with EfW)   </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Bold'>without energy recovery </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold'>(without EfW) </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#333333'>    Incineration with EfW processed waste tonnes keeps increasing. Although incineration without EfW increased the last ten years, it keeps dropping in tonnage. London and the UK still focussed on improving recycling/reusing treatment routes, but meantime, it looks like incineration with EfW will play an important part on residual waste management.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>    The efforts for reducing tonnes of waste to be sent to incineration without EfW are working, London, and The UK, is investing more on incineration with energy recovery.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#333333'>More information:</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      <format attr='margin-bottom' value='0' />
                      <format attr='padding' value='5' />
                      <format attr='padding-bottom' value='0' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='21' h='595' id='241' is-fixed='true' name='ArticleEnergyCentre' show-title='false' w='40702' x='0' y='72514'>
                    <layout-cache fixed-size-w='468' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone h='595' id='254' name='ArticleUKdirty' show-title='false' w='40702' x='0' y='73109'>
                    <layout-cache fixed-size-h='21' fixed-size-w='297' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
